        "TileImage": "$($repository 288884c1-daed-449e-b925-69532eedf353).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning, 47. A high-ranking defector has leaked intelligence about a rogue cell operating inside the Soviet airfield. Three local personnel-Leo Kazantsev, Sebastian Murray, and James Martin-are preparing to smuggle classifield jet engine blueprints out of the country.\rTo prevent a global crisis, eliminate the targets using their own security ranks to compromise the internal network. Time is short. Good luck",
